   "certs": "doubling 12->18 at 3810 (2022-12); timestamp chain 2021..2025",
   "armor": "wave-1 fires at 3802 (5/7), wave-2 completes at 4604 (7/7); legacy retires 4003..4402",
   "psp": "platform event at 3802 (42/50 types move); quiet at 3802->3810 (7/50)",
   "geometry": "packed share creeps 55.9->60.3 up to 4604, dips at 4655"
  },
  "day0_rule": "on the dumped image: geometry first (seconds, anomaly flag), certs second (the missing coordinate, no pierce), AGESA third (pins the rung), armor and PSP confirm — no single clock is decisive alone; (cert_count, AGESA) alone resolves all nine rungs"
 },
