 "honesty": [
  "the fusion inherits every honesty line of its five sources; nothing here was re-measured",
  "the cert clock's state value is the DER COUNT + timestamp year, both read from subjects, no cryptographic verification (ring 19 line)",
  "geometry classes are 64-KiB window heuristics; the packed share is a share, not a measurement of payload identity",
  "the resolving-pair computation treats the clocks as categorical; two rungs with equal clock values are 'unseparated' even if a finer lens could split them",
  "the TUF 4645 specimen (another board) is deliberately out of the fused table — same-vendor cross-board dating needs its own ring"
